Relevant tables & columns and their potential usage for the requested task  

• WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_VECTORS_US.NATURE  
  • "id": unique article identifier – to be returned in result set and to act as join key when needed  
  • "date": publication date – to be returned in result set  
  • "title": article title – to be returned in result set  
  • "body": full‑text body – needs to be tokenised into words  
  • (optionally "abstract", "keywords", "category", … if further filtering is desired)  

